[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0590","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0590.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0057","title":"Cisco CBOS ICMP Echo 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco 600 系列路由器上运行的 CBOS 固件 2.4.1 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标设备发送特制的大尺寸 ICMP Echo（Ping）数据包，导致路由器 CPU 资源耗尽或系统崩溃，造成网络服务中断。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需构造异常大小的 ICMP 报文即可触发，影响范围涵盖 Cisco 600 系列路由器产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0057"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco CBOS 至 2.4.2 或更高版本。Cisco 已发布安全公告 (http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-multiple.shtml) 提供补丁。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界配置 ACL 限制 ICMP 报文大小或速率作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-multiple.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5629","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0057.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0057.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0057.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0057","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0057.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0057.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0057.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0057.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0057.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/80a58667e7dc9efd6d76b74cf4de29bd42310fd5/2001/CVE-2001-0057.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0590.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0589","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0056","title":"Cisco CBOS Web管理接口密码猜测漏洞","description":"Cisco CBOS 2.4.1 及更早版本路由器中的 Web 管理接口存在登录日志缺失漏洞。由于系统未对无效登录尝试进行记录，远程攻击者可在不被察觉的情况下对管理接口实施暴力密码猜测攻击，成功后可获取设备管理权限，进而窃取敏感信息、篡改配置或中断服务。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0056"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco CBOS 至 2.4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Web 管理接口未记录登录失败的问题。如无法立即升级，可在路由器上配置访问控制列表（ACL），限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 Web 管理端口，或直接禁用远程 Web 管理功能以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-multiple.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5628","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0056.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0056.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0056.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0056","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0056.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0056.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0056.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0056.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0056.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/80a58667e7dc9efd6d76b74cf4de29bd42310fd5/2001/CVE-2001-0056.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0589.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0589.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0588","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0588.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0055","title":"Cisco 600系列路由器 CBOS SYN数据包 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco 600 系列路由器上运行的 CBOS 2.4.1 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标路由器发送缓慢的 TCP SYN 数据包流，耗尽设备连接表资源，导致路由器无法处理新的合法连接请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 Cisco 600 系列路由器的正常网络服务运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0055"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco 600 系列路由器 CBOS 至 2.4.2 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在路由器上配置 TCP 拦截（TCP intercept）功能，限制半开连接数量，或在边界防火墙上设置 SYN 流量速率限制，丢弃异常高频的 SYN 数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-multiple.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5627","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2001/CVE-2001-0055.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0055.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0055","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0055.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0055.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0055.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0055.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0055.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2001/CVE-2001-0055.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0588.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0586","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0586.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0046","title":"Microsoft Windows SNMP 服务注册表权限信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 系统中，SNMP Parameters 注册表项的默认权限配置不当，未对远程用户进行充分访问控制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络访问目标系统的注册表，读取并可能修改 SNMP 团体字符串（community strings）。获取团体字符串后，攻击者能够进一步利用 SNMP 协议收集敏感网络配置信息、设备拓扑及系统参数，或在具备修改权限的情况下篡改网络配置，造成信息泄露及网络管理层面的安全风险。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 及 Windows 2000 平台，CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0046"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-095 发布的修复工具 regacl40，对 Windows NT 4.0 注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\SNMP\\Parameters\\PermittedManagers 和 ValidCommunities 及其子项设置权限，仅允许 Administrators、System 和 Creator Owner 完全控制，移除其他用户的读取权限。若系统不需要 SNMP 服务，请在控制面板中直接卸载 SNMP 组件。同时建议升级到受支持的 Windows 版本，或在远程注册表（Winreg）键上禁用远程访问权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2066","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-095","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5672","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A139","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0046","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2001/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8aab22d02785f79271894073fc1a1d558c4aae6b/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0046.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0046.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0046.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0586.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0585","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0585.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0044","title":"Lexmark MarkVision 打印机驱动缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Lexmark MarkVision 打印机驱动程序中存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 cat_network、cat_parallel 和 cat_serial 命令传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取系统特权提升。该漏洞影响运行 Lexmark MarkVision 驱动程序的 Windows 系统，攻击者需具有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0044"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"立即移除 MarkVision 驱动程序文件（cat_network、cat_parallel、cat_serial）的 setuid/setgid 权限：`chmod u-s /path/to/cat_network /path/to/cat_parallel /path/to/cat_serial`。如不需要打印机管理功能，直接卸载 Lexmark MarkVision 软件包。若必须使用，限制可执行文件的属主为 root 且仅允许管理员组执行：`chown root:admin /path/to/* && chmod 750 /path/to/*`，并对所有命令行参数做长度校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0064.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2075","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5651","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5828423617831cae14862aac31158752df709f44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0044","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/74a5eea2f8e7bbf8745be52f073af8f9cdbbb080/2001/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0044.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0044.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0044.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0584","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0039","title":"IPSwitch IMail SMTP AUTH 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 6.0.5 在 SMTP AUTH 命令处理中存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送长度介于 80 至 136 字节之间的 base64 编码用户密码触发该漏洞，导致邮件服务中断。该漏洞影响运行 Ipswitch IMail 6.0.5 版本的邮件服务器，攻击者利用特制载荷可使 SMTP 服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求，造成服务不可用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0039"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.0.6 或更高版本（厂商已发布修复该 SMTP AUTH 拒绝服务漏洞的补丁），若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制仅信任 IP 访问 SMTP 端口（默认 25），或临时禁用 SMTP AUTH 认证功能作为缓解措施。参考厂商公告：http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/IMail/news.html 及 Bugtraq 披露：http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0071.html","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0071.html","http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/IMail/news.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2083","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5674","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0039","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2001/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0039.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0039.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0039.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0583","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0583.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0035","title":"KTH Kerberos IV 缓冲区溢出远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"KTH Kerberos IV 的 kdc_reply_cipher 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 Kerberos IV 密钥分发中心（KDC）发送超长的认证请求数据包触发该缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝或可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 KTH Kerberos IV 的服务器系统，攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用此漏洞，造成系统服务中断或在特定条件下获取系统控制权限。管理员应及时升级至修复版本以消除安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0035"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 KTH Kerberos IV 并升级到支持的 Kerberos 实现。直接迁移到 MIT Kerberos 5 或更新版本，通过应用安全更新来修补漏洞。如果迁移不立即可能，那么部署强化认证机制并严格限制对 Kerberos 服务的网络访问以减少攻击面。考虑部署网络入侵检测系统来监控对 Kerberos 的异常认证流量行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0093.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0105.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0511.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5734","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0035","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b4388551935a161c058c6e5c833599d33c7e097/2001/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0035.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241