sis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0093.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0105.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-025.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5754","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0036","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/da1453d4cae0dea874922584911158e4da10a575/2001/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0036.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0036.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0037","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0089","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.0 至 5.5 版本中存在文件上传表单漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTML 表单中构造恶意的 INPUT TYPE=FILE 元素，诱使用户访问特制网页，从而读取客户端任意文件内容。该漏洞利用条件较低，攻击者只需诱导受害者打开恶意页面即可实施攻击，可能导致敏感信息泄露。由于无需用户交互即可触发文件读取操作，该漏洞在早期浏览器安全防护较弱的背景下影响广泛。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0089"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 IE 6.0 中修复。由于 IE 5.x 系列已停止技术支持，建议迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或 Chrome 等现代浏览器。如无法升级，可在浏览器安全设置中将「将文件上载到服务器时包含本地目录路径」设为禁用，并启用 Internet 区域保护模式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-093","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5615","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20459","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0089","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08861b52e373e5d8411b1b6670fe650ef2757f4b/2001/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0089.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0089.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0037.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0030","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0066","title":"Secure Locate slocate 本地内存破坏漏洞","description":"Secure Locate（slocate）是一款用于文件索引和搜索的工具，其数据库文件解析功能存在内存破坏漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的数据库文件，在其中指定超出预期缓冲区边界的偏移值，触发内存越界访问，导致程序内存损坏。成功利用该漏洞的攻击者可获取目标系统的最高权限，实现本地权限提升。攻击条件要求攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，能够将特制数据库文件放置于目标系统上并诱导 slocate 解析该文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0066"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 slocate 至 2.6 及以上版本。Debian 用户执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install slocate`，Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:128 提供的更新包。如无法升级，限制不可信用户对 slocate 数据库文件的写入权限，并移除 slocate 的 setuid 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0356.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000369","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001217a","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-085.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-128.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2004","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2001-February/000144.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5594","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0066","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2001/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0066.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0066.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0028","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0054","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP 服务器目录遍历漏洞","description":"Serv-U FTP Server 2.5i 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者通过在 CD 命令后附加 \"/..%20.\" 等特殊构造字符串，可突破 FTP 根目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入的路径参数过滤不严，未正确校验 \"..\" 目录跳转序列，结合 URL 编码绕过机制实现路径穿越。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，可能导致敏感信息泄露，如配置文件、密码文件等。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0054"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Serv-U FTP Server 至 2.5i 或更高版本，该版本修复了 CD 命令中 \"/..%20.\" 字符串导致的目录遍历问题。如无法升级，限制匿名用户对 FTP 根目录的访问权限，并在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务（默认端口 21）的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0043.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97604119024280&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/464","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5639","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20461","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0054","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2001/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0054.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0054.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2001-0054.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0026","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0052","title":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 畸形查询拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 6.1 及 7.1 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地用户可通过向数据库发送特制的畸形查询语句，导致数据库服务进程崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，攻击复杂度较低，无需身份认证即可触发，仅影响系统可用性，不涉及机密性和完整性。IBM 已在后续版本更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0052"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33Z","remediation":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 已停止支持，无官方补丁。建议升级到受支持的 IBM Db2 版本（如 11.5+），或迁移至其他受支持的数据库产品。如无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 DB2 服务的访问（默认端口 50000），仅允许可信 IP 连接，并监控异常 SQL 查询流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149207","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2067","https://exchange.xforce.ibmclou